{
  "id": "SprintRender0002",
  "name": "02 Clips to Finished Ad",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 02 · Clips to Finished Ad\n**Problem:** AI video tools give you raw 8-second clips. Turning them into a post-ready ad (right size, captions, end card) is slow, repetitive editing.\n\n**What happens**\n1. The owner sends the clips to the Telegram bot (or `/demo` for placeholder clips).\n2. Each clip is stored by the **media-worker** service. After the 3rd clip the ad is rendered:\n   1080x1920 vertical, captions from the content calendar burned in, branded end card.\n3. The finished video comes back on Telegram with **Approve / Redo** buttons.\n4. The calendar row is set to `READY`.\n\nn8n cannot run ffmpeg itself, so it calls a small custom service over HTTP.",
        "height": 360,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "77760473-0737-5050-8f20-8664837626b0",
      "name": "Note 0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -160
      ]
    },
